  "thag1.2:0.3": "",
  "thag1.2:0.4": "2. Mahākoṭṭhikattheragāthā 2. ",
  "thag1.2:1.1": "‘‘Upasanto uparato, ",
  "thag1.2:1.2": "mantabhāṇī anuddhato; ",
  "thag1.2:1.3": "Dhunāti pāpake dhamme, ",
  "thag1.2:1.4": "dumapattaṃva māluto’’ti. ",
  "thag1.2:1.5": "Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā mahākoṭṭhiko thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthāti. "
}
